Changes made in TabAOD: rewritten in Java and drawn on a Canvas instead of a TextView
with SystemUI's TextAnimator; font weight set through font variation settings.
The AOSP source file itself is not included. The font is read at runtime from the
device (/system/fonts/AndroidClock.ttf) and is not bundled.

Bundled fonts (assets/fonts), each licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
Full license texts are in assets/fonts/licenses/ and are packaged inside the app.
  - Fredoka               (fonts/Fredoka.ttf)
  - Big Shoulders Display (fonts/BigShouldersDisplay.ttf)
  - Bodoni Moda           (fonts/BodoniModa.ttf)
Source: https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/ directory). The fonts are unmodified.
